# Same markup as tools/interactive-math-statistics/worksheets_content.py: {a/b} stacked fraction, ^{} sup, _{} sub, **bold**;
# "?" starts a blank table cell (key answer after it); ___ blanks in rules are filled in order.
# Every numeric answer is recomputed by tests/worksheet-answers.py.

